# Docker build context is the repo root. Keep it lean: ship only source +
# manifests, never installed deps or build outputs (those are produced inside
# the image so the build is reproducible).

# Dependencies & build outputs
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# VCS & tooling
.git
.gitignore
.github
.husky
.vscode
.idea
.claude

# Local test/screenshot artifacts
.playwright-mcp
.playwright-screenshots
.playwright-report

# Docs & non-build top-level dirs
**/*.md
# …except the explorer's model prompts, read at runtime (specs/018). Without
# this every Ask that missed a card answered 500 "Prompt ask.v1.md not found".
!api/src/explorer/prompts/*.md
docs
terraform
pipelines
scripts

# Secrets — never copy real env files into an image
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Stray nested pnpm files: the root lockfile/workspace is authoritative.
# These would make pnpm treat client/ as its own workspace root.
client/pnpm-lock.yaml
client/pnpm-workspace.yaml

# Docker files themselves
**/Dockerfile
.dockerignore
